   - The registry has a conflicting route at port 18789 for assistant.ghostbridge.tech

2. **Architecture Requirements:**
   - Plugin objects must be at `/org/opdbus/v1/plugins/<plugin>` only
   - Reads must go through projection tree (served by projection_serv)
   - Writes must go through MutationEngine → subid_router compliance gate
   - All operations must be schema-driven

